     "content": "\u010a\u010aFINALACTIONS:\u010aopen(box_lid)\u010apick(mug2)\u010aplace(mug2,\u0120inside_box)\u010apick(mug3)\u010aplace(mug3,\u0120inside_box)\u010apick(can_of_beans)\u010aplace(can_of_beans,\u0120cupboard_shelf)\u010apick(spam)\u010aplace(spam,\u0120cupboard_shelf)\u010apick(sugar)\u010aplace(sugar,\u0120cupboard_shelf)\u010apick(mug1)\u010aplace(mug1,\u0120inside_box)",
